        DF["🏭 DriverFactory"]
        LD["💾 LocalDriver"]
        DD["🐳 DockerDriver"]
        CE["🔒 CryptoEngine"]
        VA["🗄️ Vault"]
    end

    subgraph Storage["💿 Storage Layer"]
        DB["📁 SQLite DB"]
        FS["📂 Filesystem"]
    end

    A -->|set/get/delete| WA
    WA --> DF
    DF -->|is Docker?| DD
    DD -->|read| DOCKER
    DOCKER -->|not found| DF
